ALVA — Special Ability Reclassification, Animation Improvements & Home Screen Web-App Installation

Objective

Implement two major improvements to Alva:

1. Correct the classification of Special abilities, adjust the relevant animations, and add an orange exclamation-mark indicator above a character while performing a Special ability.
2. Make the Home Screen’s bottom-right Download button functional, with an informative installation dialog, native Add to Home Screen support wherever available, and an attention-catching download icon animation.

Inspect the existing architecture before making changes. Implement everything using the game’s current design conventions and data-driven systems. Preserve existing combat mechanics, move identities, controller bindings, UI styling, and responsiveness.

Repository: hiyroscript/alva

Alva is a vanilla JavaScript, HTML, CSS, and Canvas 2D platform fighting game without a framework or build step.

